msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Setup {#setup}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "First, import the required packages and tools.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SQOA Solver accepts a QUBO problem as a coefficient dictionary in the tuple-"
"string format used by IBM&reg; optimization functions. Define a helper "
"function that converts the QUBO returned by `OptimizationProblemToQubo` into"
" this format.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The converter always returns a minimization problem, which matches how SQOA "
"Solver treats a dictionary problem. The keys use the variable indices of the"
" QUBO, and every variable receives a linear entry, even with a zero "
"coefficient, so that the returned solution covers all variables.\n"
msgstr ""

